   .. group-tab:: LED Strip

      Operate with the RGB digital LED strip :hwftlbl-led:`200 RGB`
      at :rpi-pico-pio:`PIO0` / :rpi-pico-pio:`GP22`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip get_length led_strip**
            ws2812-20x10 has 200 pixel(s)

      Sett all LEDs to :brd:`RED`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 070000 200**

      Sett all LEDs to :byl:`YELLOW`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 070700 200**

      Sett all LEDs to :bgn:`GREEN`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 000700 200**

      Sett all LEDs to :bcy:`CYAN`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 000707 200**

      Sett all LEDs to :bbl:`BLUE`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 000007 200**

      Sett all LEDs to :bma:`MAGENTA`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 070007 200**

      Sett all LEDs to :bwt:`WHITE` (all on):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 070707 200**

      Sett all LEDs to :bbk:`BLACK` (all off):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led_strip fill led_strip 000000 200**

   .. group-tab:: ADC

      Operate with the on-shield high-resistance LDR :hwftlbl:`Rₗ`
      on :rpi-pico-adc:`ADC_CH0`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **adc adc@4004c000 resolution 12**
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **adc adc@4004c000 print**
            adc\ @\ 4004c000:
            Gain: 1
            Reference: INTERNAL
            Acquisition Time: 0
            Channel ID: 0
            Differential: 0
            Resolution: 12

